## Breakfast at the front

The breakfast room looks out onto Ceintuurbaan through tall arched windows, with marble tables and the tram passing outside. Breakfast runs from 07:30 to 10:30 every day at €17.50 per person, and guests who book direct pay ten percent less.

There is no restaurant for lunch or dinner, but De Pijp is one of the better neighbourhoods in Amsterdam to be hungry in. Ask at reception and someone will point you to a table.
